  "description": "Shin-Ah’s love life has been...hands-free ever since her boyfriend left. Her favorite toy? Reliable. Discreet. Perfect. Until one night, mid–happy time, a glowing portal appears, and out pops a strange man...with his “wand” still inside her. Turns out, Shin-Ah’s favorite toy was magically linked to Kai McGreen, a cocky sorcerer from another world who’s very familiar with the sensation. Now stuck in a fantasy realm with a possessive (and ridiculously attractive) magician who refuses to let her go, shy Shin-Ah is in for a wild, magical ride.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
